{"title":"2013 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 21","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_By_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution By WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Samantha lives 2 blocks west and 1 block south of the southwest corner of City Park. Her school is 2 blocks east and 2 blocks north of the northeast corner of City Park. On school days she bikes on streets to the southwest corner of City Park, then takes a diagonal path through the park to the northeast corner, and then bikes on streets to school. If her route is as short as possible, how many different routes can she take?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/1/3c1dc5925544b75b86efceec438d433a39f318bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 3 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 6 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 9 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 12 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"366\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_By_WhyMath\">Video Solution By WhyMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution By WhyMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/9nveueuZiqs\">https://youtu.be/9nveueuZiqs</a> ~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/c/c4c258dbd1d28f8138a2d43632bd2c86b1864e5e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] unitsize(8mm); for(int i=0; i&lt;=8; ++i) { draw((0,i)--(8,i)); draw((i,0)--(i,8)); } fill((2,1)--(6,1)--(6,6)--(2,6)--cycle); for(int j=0; j&lt;= 38; ++j) { draw((0,0)--(2,0)--(2,1)--(0,1)--(0,0), black+linewidth(3)); draw((6,6)--(6,8)--(8,8)--(8,6)--(6,6), black+linewidth(3)); }[/asy]\" width=\"308\" height=\"308\" />\n</p><p>Using <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Combinations\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Combinations\">combinations</a>, we get that the number of ways to get from Samantha's house to City Park is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/a/a7a0265a144a2623025d57de45a4947c23c52f25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\binom31 = \\dfrac{3!}{1!2!} = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"129\" height=\"55\" />, and the number of ways to get from City Park to school is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/5/2254893863914b9a2a99cabc09bd326dc9e6c612.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\binom42= \\dfrac{4!}{2!2!} = \\dfrac{4\\cdot 3}{2} = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"186\" height=\"53\" />. Since there's one way to go through City Park (just walking straight through), the number of different ways to go from Samantha's house to City Park to school <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/e/9aea73459ef384dbfe23a37593b366db0dc4f198.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3\\cdot 6 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ 18}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8\" title=\"2013 AMC 8\">2013 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2013 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2013 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2013\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2013 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 20\">Problem 20</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=20